{"id":"NCT04282083","title":"Protocol ITANET - Registry","official":"ITANET -Registry: Multicentric Collection of Cases on Neuroendocrin Gastro-Entero-Pancreatic Tumors (Title in Local Language: ITANET -Registry: Raccolta Multicentrica Dei Casi di Tumore Neuroendocrino Gastro-Entero-Pancreatico)","summary":"This is a prospective observational study with the aim to create an Italian database for the collection of data on diagnostic approach, therapy and follow up of patients affected by GEP-NET (gastro-enteric-pancreatic neuroendocrine tumours). Data for approximately 200 italian patients were already previously collected in the ENETS database (international database). ENETS decided to interrupt the collection of the data for an indefinite period. For this reason, through an amendment (number 1) to the protocol, ITANET (Italian Association Neuro-endocrine Tumors) decided to transfer the italian data into a national database and to go on with the collection/update of the data, in order not to lose important clinical information.","conditions":["Gastro-entero Pancreatic Neuroendocrine Tumors"],"interventions":[],"criteria":"Inclusion Criteria:\n\n* age\\> or = 18 years;\n* histologically/cytologically proved diagnosis of NET OR diagnosis supported by a PET Gallium 68 positivity and by at least a contrastografic imaging of second level (CT scan or NMR);\n* Diagnosis of GEP-NET not antecedent 1 year since the Informed Consent signature;\n* Grading G1, G2, G3 according to the classification WHO 2019;\n* Tumor origin in digestive apparatus (GEP NETs) or tumor of unknown origin;\n* Signed Informed consent.\n\nExclusion Criteria:\n\n* Known tumor origin different from digestive apparatus (GEP NETs);\n* no evidence of histologically/cytologically proved diagnosis of NET OR diagnosis supported by a PET Gallium 68 positivity and by at least a contrastografic imaging of second level (CT scan or NMR);\n* Diagnosis of GEP-NET antecedent 1 year since the Informed Consent signature.","minAge":"18 Years","maxAge":"","sex":"ALL","healthy":false,"studyType":"OBSERVATIONAL","purpose":"","enrollment":3600,"start":"2019-05-25","pcd":"2027-07-31","upd":"2024-01-25","sponsor":"Italian Association Neuroendocrine Tumors","areas":["oncology","rare"],"central":["Francesco Panzuto · +390633775605 · fpanzuto@ospedalesantandrea.it","Maria Rinzivillo · +390633775605 · mrinzivillo@ospedalesantandrea.it"],"sites":[{"f":"Istituto Clinico Humanitas","city":"Rozzano","pr":"","zip":"20089","s":"R","lat":45.3819,"lon":9.1559,"c":"Alexia Bertuzzi · 0039 02 8224 4599 · alexia.bertuzzi@cancercenter.humanitas.it"},{"f":"Clinica Pederzoli","city":"Peschiera del Garda","pr":"","zip":"","s":"R","lat":45.4391,"lon":10.6861,"c":"Giovanni Butturini · butturinichirurgo@gmail.com"},{"f":"AO Ospedali Riuniti","city":"Ancona","pr":"","zip":"","s":"R","lat":43.6072,"lon":13.5103,"c":"Rossana Berardi · rossana.berardi@ospedaliriuniti.marche.it"},{"f":"Azienda Ospedaliera Universitaria Consorziale Policlinico","city":"Bari","pr":"","zip":"70124","s":"R","lat":41.1207,"lon":16.8698,"c":"Mauro Cives · +390805592859 · mauro.cives@uniba.it"},{"f":"Azienda Ospedaliera Universitaria Policlinico S. Orsola Malpighi","city":"Bologna","pr":"","zip":"40100","s":"R","lat":44.4938,"lon":11.3387,"c":"Davide Campana · +390512143067 · davide.campana@unibo.it"},{"f":"IRCCS Azienda Ospedaliera-Universitaria di Bologna","city":"Bologna","pr":"","zip":"40133","s":"R","lat":44.4938,"lon":11.3387,"c":"Laura Mastrangelo · +393477251184 · laura.mastrangelo@ausl.bologna.it"},{"f":"Ospedale Regionale di Bolzano","city":"Bolzano","pr":"","zip":"","s":"R","lat":46.4907,"lon":11.3398,"c":"Michele Ciola · +39 0471 908468 · michele.ciola@sabes.it"},{"f":"ASST Spedali Civili","city":"Brescia","pr":"","zip":"","s":"R","lat":45.5356,"lon":10.2147,"c":"Vito Amoroso · vitoamoroso@alice.it"},{"f":"Presidio Ospedaliero A. Perrino","city":"Brindisi","pr":"","zip":"","s":"R","lat":40.6322,"lon":17.9361,"c":"Saverio Cinier